      "content": "You could introduce \"Benny,\" a low-raperee who owes favors to everyone and answers to no one, whose constant stutter and nervous tic highlight the fragility of the city's shadows. Add \"Nina,\" a cynical and highly efficient informant who treats illegal dealings like a complex math problem, creating a dangerous intellectual standoff with your detective. Finally, feature \"Doc Jackson,\" an aging hitman who believes in honor among thieves, providing a grim mentorship role that forces your protagonist to confront the brutal reality his intellect cannot solve. These characters will create a stark contrast between the theoretical world of your hero and the chaotic, visceral survival of the street.",
