    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Those are a good start. I like the Doc Jackson idea. I want the city to feel really authentic and grounded, though. For the street-level guys like Benny and the ones running the local crews, can you give them more specific ethnic or cultural backgrounds? I want to make sure their dialogue and the way they carry themselves feels \"real\" for their specific neighborhood in the city. It'll help with that gritty, immersive feeling.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
